Really interesting question.  Unfortunately, it looks like the dev team 
thought of that.  When you dig through from the level above you always end
up somewhere in the maze to the left of the castle.

Well, almost always.  There is a possibility that you will fall through more
than one floor.  So you could end up BELOW the castle.  If you make your
way back up, you'll now be in the maze to the right of the castle.  That
still doesn't get you into the castle -- you still need to get over the
trap doors somehow.

